	<key>Lists the %lld places that use %@ in Find in Project.</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSStringLocalizedFormatKey</key>
		<string>%2$#@value@</string>
		<key>value</key>
		<dict>
			<key>NSStringFormatSpecTypeKey</key>
			<string>NSStringPluralRuleType</string>
			<key>NSStringFormatValueTypeKey</key>
			<string>lld</string>
			<key>one</key>
			<string>ᱯᱨᱚᱡᱮᱠᱴ ᱨᱮ ᱧᱟᱢ ᱨᱮ %1$@ ᱵᱮᱵᱷᱟᱨᱮᱫ %2$lld ᱴᱷᱟᱶ ᱮ ᱥᱩᱫᱩᱜᱼᱟ᱾</string>
			<key>other</key>
			<string>ᱯᱨᱚᱡᱮᱠᱴ ᱨᱮ ᱧᱟᱢ ᱨᱮ %1$@ ᱵᱮᱵᱷᱟᱨᱮᱫ %2$lld ᱴᱷᱟᱶ ᱠᱚ ᱮ ᱥᱩᱫᱩᱜᱼᱟ᱾</string>
